+	/* The BAR window an iomem mapping refers to is not refcounted: every
+	 * ttm_bo_vunmap() of this buffer, and the fbdev damage flush does one
+	 * per update, releases it through ttm_mem_io_free(), after which it
+	 * can be handed out to a different buffer. Use the mapping only while
+	 * the buffer still owns the bus address it was created for.
